{"id":"3111edba781f7f46","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-scale.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive2 Scale","display":"df-zfc-descriptive2-scale — ZFC Descriptive2 Scale","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-scale","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive2-scale"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive2-scale — ZFC Descriptive2 Scale","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-scale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive2-scale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive2-scale — ZFC Descriptive2 Scale"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\varphi,A\\in V\">\\(\\vec\\varphi,A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2Scale}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2Scale}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}scale} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2Scale}_S(\\vec\\varphi,A)\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\nA\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\varphi,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\varphi))\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\varphi(n),A,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\varphi(n)))\\land\\forall y\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\vec\\varphi(n)(y))\\right)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall g\\;\\forall\\lambda\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\omega,A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\lambda,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\lambda))\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda(n))\\land\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\n(i\\geq N\\to g(i){\\upharpoonright}m=x{\\upharpoonright}m)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\n(i\\geq N\\to\\vec\\varphi(n)(g(i))=\\lambda(n))\n\\bigr]\\to\n\\bigl[x\\in A\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\vec\\varphi(n)(x)\\leq\\lambda(n))\\bigr]\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}scale} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2Scale}_S(\\vec\\varphi,A)\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\nA\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\varphi,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\varphi))\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\varphi(n),A,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\varphi(n)))\\land\\forall y\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\vec\\varphi(n)(y))\\right)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall g\\;\\forall\\lambda\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\omega,A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\lambda,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\lambda))\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda(n))\\land\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\n(i\\geq N\\to g(i){\\upharpoonright}m=x{\\upharpoonright}m)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\n(i\\geq N\\to\\vec\\varphi(n)(g(i))=\\lambda(n))\n\\bigr]\\to\n\\bigl[x\\in A\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\vec\\varphi(n)(x)\\leq\\lambda(n))\\bigr]\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The final implication is the scale convergence condition; the former placeholders <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Norms}\">\\(\\operatorname{Norms}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ScaleClosure}\">\\(\\operatorname{ScaleClosure}\\)</span> carried no formal content.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","loca